Error [E0146]: `const` is retired — write `$name`
  --> tests/ui/const_retired.jet:1:1
    |
  1 | const retired = 1
    | ^^^^^
 Why: explicit compile-time demand is a mark on an immutable binding
 Fix: write `$name :: …` (or `#Persist name := …` for hot-reload state)

Error [E0107]: nothing named `retired` exists here
  --> tests/ui/const_retired.jet:4:11
    |
  4 |     print(retired)
    |           ^^^^^^^
 Why: a name must be declared before it's used
 Fix: did you mean `$retired`?
